gvcv5.mr_cpt.crashed0.name=S.O.S......S.O.S.....
gvcv5.mr_cpt.crashed1.name=Nearby... Allied forces... Rescue... Request...
gvcv5.mr_cpt.crashed2.name=Here... Few survivors... Rescue...
gvcv5.mr_cpt.crashed3.name=Rescue forces! We are holed up in the bow of the ship.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk0.name=Allied officer: Rescue forces! ... I see...
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk1.name=Allied officer: Our ship has been destroyed by a guerrilla sea jacking.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk2.name=Allied officer: We are the only survivors.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk3.name=Allied officer: I want you to lead the remaining forces and destroy the six jamming devices inside the ship.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk4.name=Allied officer: The guerrillas have installed jamming devices, making long-distance communication impossible.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk5.name=Allied officer: If we destroy all the jamming devices, we should be able to request a rescue force.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk6.name=Allied Officer: After the rescue team arrives, wipe out the guerrillas.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.talk7.name=Allied Officer: You're the only ones we can rely on. Please do your best.
gvcv5.mr_cpt.jamming_destroy0.name=Allied Officer: Great! We've destroyed all the jamming devices!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.jamming_destroy1.name=Allied Officer: Request the rescue team immediately!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.jamming_destroy2.name=Allied Officer: Great! It's our airborne troops!
gvcv5.precv.crashed0.name=Allied Officer: Great! We've recaptured the ship!
gvcv5.precv.crashed1.name=Allied Forces Soldier: !? ... Unidentified aircraft detected on radar!
gvcv5.precv.crashed2.name=Allied Forces Officer: New guerrilla forces!?
gvcv5.precv.crashed3.name=Allied Forces Soldier: No, this is... an unidentified aircraft!   It's not responding to IFF either!
gvcv5.precv.crashed4.name=Allied Forces Officer: Damn it, prepare to intercept!
gvcv5.precv.crashed5.name=Allied Forces Soldier: We'll engage in one minute! 12 o'clock direction!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave1.name=Allied Forces Officer: They're here! Fire back!!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave1_new_enemy.name=Allied Forces Officer: Damn it! They're back again!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave2_cool.name=Allied Forces Soldier: Unidentified unit approaching from the 6 o'clock direction!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave2.name=Allied Forces Officer: Enough is enough!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave2_new_enemy.name=Allied Forces Soldier: Unidentified unit approaching further!
gvcv5.mr_cpt.wave3_cool.name=Allied Forces Soldier: Unidentified unit approaching from the 12 o'clock and 6 o'clock directions!
