script.gvcv5.battleInfo.name=Battle info: def is the defense rate; armor and resistance effects increase it, reducing damage taken. Damage is generally "base weapon power × target multiplier × (1 - def)". A headshot lowers def and increases damage, while a shot to the feet raises def and reduces damage. damageIgnoreDef is the penetration value; a vehicle takes no damage if its armor value is higher than this value.

