script.gvcv5:boss_name.name=Set the name of the location
script.gvcv5:boss_kill.name=Destroy the base
script.gvcv5:boss_end.name=The end.
script.gvcv5.boss_kill_body.name=If you destroy a base, the base's flag will disappear, and you will lose ownership of the base. Please consult with your team leader before destroying a base.

script.gvcv5.phone_progress.name=Mission
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_c.name=Progress:
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_0.name=MISSION1
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_0_main.name=-Eliminate the Guerrillas-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_0_sub.name=Eliminate the guerrillas that have been sighted in various locations. The guerrillas appear at various bases and at night.
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_1.name=MISSION2
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_1_main.name=-Destroy the Guerrilla Spawner-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_1_sub.name=Destroy the beacon that attracts the guerrillas. You can destroy the beacon either directly or by using an explosion.
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_2.name=MISSION3
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_2_main.name=-Eliminate the Veteran Guerrillas-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_2_sub.name=Eliminate the heavily armed veteran guerrillas. Veteran guerrillas appear at various outposts and at night. They are tougher opponents than regular guerrillas.
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_3.name=MISSION4
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_3_main.name=-Conquer the Medium-Sized Base-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_3_sub.name=Attack the base occupied by the guerrillas. Damage the flag; if you destroy it, you can capture the base.
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_4.name=MISSION5
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_4_main.name=-Destroy the Guerrilla Tank-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_4_sub.name=Destroy the outdated tanks being used by the guerrillas. Bullets won't work on them—fire rockets at them.
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_5.name=MISSION6
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_5_main.name=-Conquer the Large-Scale Base-
script.gvcv5.phone_progress_5_sub.name=Capture the large base where guerrillas are hiding. Unidentified weapons have been spotted—proceed with caution.


