script.gvcv5:gun_type.sg.name=Shotgun
script.gvcv5:gun_type.sg_desc.name=Fires spreading bullets. Highly effective at close range.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.ar.name=Assault Rifle
script.gvcv5:gun_type.ar_desc.name=A rifle capable of rapid fire. It is highly effective at medium range.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.sr.name=Sniper Rifle
script.gvcv5:gun_type.sr_desc.name=Fires high-damage rounds. It cannot fire in rapid succession, but each shot deals significant damage. Best suited for long-range combat.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.ms.name=Sniper Rifle
script.gvcv5:gun_type.ms_desc.name=A rifle designed for medium-range use. It can fire more rapidly than a sniper rifle.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.lmg.name=Light Machine Gun
script.gvcv5:gun_type.lmg_desc.name=A machine gun capable of rapid fire. It has a large magazine capacity and high firepower, but it's unwieldy.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.gre.name=Grenade Launcher
script.gvcv5:gun_type.gre_desc.name=Fires explosive rounds. Effective against enemies.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.at.name=Anti-vehicles
script.gvcv5:gun_type.at_desc.name=Weapon designed for targeting objects. Effective against vehicles.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.hg.name=Handgun
script.gvcv5:gun_type.hg_desc.name=A pistol that can be handled with one hand. It has low firepower but is easy to handle. By holding it in your off-hand, you can use it as a dual-wielded pistol.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.smg.name=Submachine Gun
script.gvcv5:gun_type.smg_desc.name=A compact, rapid-fire gun. It has low damage but a high rate of fire and high DPS. Best suited for close-range combat.
script.gvcv5:gun_type.rpg.name=Rocket Launcher
script.gvcv5:gun_type.rpg_desc.name=Fires a rocket. It has high damage but cannot be fired in rapid succession. Effective against tanks and armored vehicles.

script.gvcv5:rarelity_desc.name=Rarity indicates how rare a weapon is. The higher the rarity, the better the performance and the greater the variety of attachments available. Rarity increases in the following order: §7 Common §r<§a Uncommon §r<§9 Rare §r<§d Epic §r<§6 Legendary §r<§c Mythic §r.
script.gvcv5:rarelity.name=Rarity:
