script.gvcv5:gun_spec.power.name=Damage Performance
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damage.name=Base Damage:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damage_desc.name=The amount of damage dealt when a bullet hits. This varies depending on the gun's enchantments and attachments, the body part hit, and the armor worn.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.basedps.name=Base DPS:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.basedps_desc.name=Base DPS is the amount of damage dealt per second. It is calculated based on base damage and the attack interval.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.interval.name=Firing Interval (Ticks):
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.interval_desc.name=The firing interval is the time it takes to fire one shot. The shorter the interval, the faster you can fire in rapid succession.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.bomb.name=Explosive Power on Impact:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.bomb_desc.name=Explosive projectiles, such as grenade launchers and rocket launchers, deal damage to the surrounding area upon impact.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damageIgnoreDef.name=Penetration Value:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damageIgnoreDef_desc.name=Penetration is the ability to penetrate a vehicle's armor. If the penetration value is lower than the armor value, no damage can be dealt.

script.gvcv5:gun_spec.use.name=Maneuverability
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.recoil.name=Reaction:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.recoil_desc.name=The amount of recoil when firing. The greater the recoil, the more the aim drifts. You can reduce recoil with attachments. §c If you turn off “Hand Shake” in Minecraft's graphics settings, recoil will be eliminated. §r
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.slowness.name=Slow Movement Speed:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.slowness_desc.name=The intensity of the slow effect applied when holding it.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.speed.name=Projectile velocity:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.speed_desc.name=The velocity of the bullet when fired.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.maxGunAmmo.name=Magazine capacity:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.maxGunAmmo_desc.name=The number of rounds that fit in the magazine. When the magazine is empty, you must reload.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.aim.name=Accuracy when shooting from the hip:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.aim_desc.name=Accuracy when firing from the hip. The higher the number, the more the bullets spread out.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.reloadTime.name=Reload Time (Ticks):
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.reloadTime_desc.name=Reload time. You must reload when the magazine is empty.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.bullet.name=Ammunition used:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.bullet_desc.name=The type of ammunition used. The ammunition varies depending on the type of firearm.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damageType.name=Ignore Invincibility Duration:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.damageType_desc.name=Whether to ignore the invincibility period that occurs after a player takes damage
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.fullauto.name=Fully automatic operation available:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.fullauto_desc.name=Can you fire continuously by holding down the fire button?
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.desc.name=Description:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.desc_desc.name=Gun description. This section describes the gun's performance and features.
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.get.name=How to Get It:
script.gvcv5:gun_spec.get_desc.name=How to Obtain Guns. This section describes various methods, such as crafting and drops.

