script.zex:bullet_hp.desc=In exchange for taking double damage, you become more susceptible to the effects of armor-based bullet resistance.
script.zex:bullet_ap.desc=In exchange for being able to deal damage to armored vehicles, you'll now be affected by invincibility frames.
script.zex:bullet_at.desc=Instead of dealing damage, you can stop enemies in their tracks. You can also shoot tranquilizer rounds at guerrillas and use the Fulton Recovery System to capture them as prisoners. By giving a captured guerrilla ammunition, they will become an Allied soldier; by giving them an emerald, they will become a PMC soldier.
script.zex:bullet_srag.desc=An attachment exclusively for shotguns. Instead of spreading, it fires a single, high-powered round.
script.zex:bullet_frag.desc=An attachment exclusively for shotguns. Instead of spreading, it fires a single explosive round.
script.zex:bullet_db.desc=An attachment exclusively for shotguns. It fires flaming rounds. While the range is reduced, these rounds can penetrate armor.
script.zex:exarrow.desc=An attachment designed exclusively for compound bows. It causes the impact point to explode.
script.zex:psarrow.desc=An attachment designed exclusively for compound bows. It applies a poison effect.

