script.gvcv5:v_spec.t34_desc.name=An outdated tank often used by guerrilla forces. Although its performance is among the lowest of all tanks, it still poses a threat to infantry.

script.gvcv5:v_spec.c130_desc.name=This is the vehicle with the largest model in this add-on. It carries Allied soldiers and PMC soldiers; if you drop an item using :_input_key.drop:, you can airdrop the NPC soldiers. Additionally, if a player gets out of a vehicle—such as the FV101 or M551—while carrying an airborne tank, they will be airdropped while still mounted on the tank.